  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">本模組新增了大多數主要TFC地質礦床，可使用Create模組的「鑽孔機」進行開採。<br>配方與工具已針對Terrafirmacraft世界中的物品進行調整與改編。<br>若要提取金屬礦石，你需要使用地質探勘儀來尋找礦脈位置，<br>然後在該處建造鑽孔機，並為鑽頭提供適當的冷卻，同時為機器供應水源。<br><br>新增與以下模組的相容性：-firmalife -tfc ie addon -mekanism</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">&nbsp;&gt;基礎礦石與岩石礦脈&lt;<br><span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;* 硫銅鉍礦&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 金銅礦&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 錫石&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 黃銅礦&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 辰砂&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;* 銅藍&nbsp;&nbsp;* 稀有寶石&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 赤鐵礦&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;* 紅土礦&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; * 磁鐵礦&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;* 馬爾頓金礦&nbsp; * 孔雀石&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;* 鎳黃鐵礦&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 黝錫礦</span><br></span></strong></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/796/464/multi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"737\" height=\"402\">=======================================================================================<br>&nbsp;* 鉻鐵礦 - Firmalife 相容<br>&nbsp;* 鋁土礦&nbsp; - TFC IE Addon 相容<br>&nbsp;* 方鉛礦&nbsp; &nbsp;- TFC IE Addon 相容<br>&nbsp;* 瀝青鈾礦 - TFC IE Addon 相容<br>&nbsp;* 鋨礦&nbsp; - Mekanism 相容<br>======================================================================================<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/796/465/multi-compat.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"727\" height=\"539\"><br>&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p><p><strong><br>預設配置 1.20.1<br></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div><br><strong>importantInfo = false</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>finiteAmountBase = 1000</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>defaultInfinite = false</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>maxExtractorsPerVein = 20</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>veinFinderNear = 8</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>veinFinderFar = 10</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>veinFinderCd = 10</strong></div>\n</div><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong><br>預設配置 1.18.2<br></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div><strong>importantInfo = false</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>generationChance = 5000</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>finiteAmountBase = 1000</strong></div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong>defaultInfinite = false</strong></div>\n<br>\n<div><strong>maxExtractorsPerVein = 0</strong></div>\n</div><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">1.18.2<br><span><iframe style=\"width:801px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MWm0LC9laF8\" width=\"801\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span><br><br></span></strong></span></p>",
